{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this crazy game inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, legendary heroes <strong>Ash and Joe</strong> take on hordes of demons! It's an endless battle for survival in hell, where each level is harder than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero, level up, crush waves of monsters, and prepare for the final showdown with the ultimate evil\u2014the Patriarch, a powerful demon with an inflated ego and an army of fanatical minions. Only strategy, teamwork, and a bit of luck can help you defeat him and maintain your sanity in this digital chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memes, demons, and madness\u2014all the things you love.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722790?t=1747074569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722790?t=1747074569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722790/22678e7b94d6c686cf8b9531fd1dc205ba32bcf9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747074569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722790/22678e7b94d6c686cf8b9531fd1dc205ba32bcf9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747074569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this crazy game inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i>, legendary heroes <strong>Ash and Joe</strong> take on hordes of demons! It's an endless battle for survival in hell, where each level is harder than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero, level up, crush waves of monsters, and prepare for the final showdown with the ultimate evil\u2014the Patriarch, a powerful demon with an inflated ego and an army of fanatical minions. Only strategy, teamwork, and a bit of luck can help you defeat him and maintain your sanity in this digital chaos.</